# Vulnerability findings the image scan accepts, each with the reason. Every entry expires,
# so the scan fails again once it needs another look.

# zod < 4.6.6: memory exhaustion validating oversized collections (GHSA-mrhx-c7xc-m3w5).
# Only @atproto/api uses zod, and only the one-shot publish-definitions job loads it: it logs
# in to bsky.social and updates the labeler record, so zod only validates bsky.social's
# responses. The service never loads it. Even the latest @atproto/api requires zod 3, and the
# fix is only in zod 4. Revisit when @atproto supports zod 4.
CVE-2023-54404 exp:2027-01-31
